# 📱 MASTER PLAN: Personal AI Project Assistant (Claude UI × Gemini)

Purpose: Personal-use, sideloaded Android app that replicates Claude's interface, uses Gemini as the engine, and acts as a full coding/modding assistant with deep device and file access. One user (you). No Play Store constraints.

