## 1. CORE CONCEPT & STARTUP FLOW

Mission: "I type a command → the AI reads my project, makes the changes, runs the build, installs it, and watches the logs."

Launch sequence:
1. Splash → Claude-styled warm cream screen
2. Workspace selection → folder picker (SAF) or raw path (adb-granted storage)
3. API key entry → stored in EncryptedSharedPreferences backed by Android Keystore
4. Model/route selection → default model + permission mode (Read-only / Ask / Auto)
5. Main chat → with action trace, diff viewer, and toolbar

