## 6. 🔒 TRUST LAYER (BUILD FIRST)

- Diff approval gate — line-level green/red diff per edit; buttons: Apply / Reject / Apply All This Turn
- Turn snapshots — files affected in a turn copied to app-private storage → "Undo this turn"
- Trash instead of delete — .ai/trash/<timestamp>/, restorable from drawer
- Git auto-checkpoint — ai-checkpoint: <summary> commit before every AI turn if .git exists
- Rollback records — every write/edit produces a one-tap rollback record
- Staleness detection — streaming hash on read; re-check before applying edit; warn on conflict
- Permission modes — Read-only / Ask / Auto, persisted per session
- Dangerous-pattern confirmation — rm -rf /, dd, > /dev/block, pm uninstall, format require a second tap
- APK signature safeguard — refuse install if signature ≠ installed package (unless flagged "replace install")
- Credential vault — keys in Keystore; logs auto-scrubbed of sk-, ghp_, PEM patterns

