## 9. 🤖 AGENTIC LOOPS & AUTONOMY

Self-healing build loop (highest priority):
build → capture errors → feed back to Gemini → AI edits → rebuild → repeat until pass

APK pipeline (one command):
apktool d → AI edits smali/XML/res → apktool b → zipalign → apksigner sign → adb install -r → logcat watch

Plan → Execute:
Multi-step tasks get a checklist plan first; execution checks off items.

Subagent teams:
Lead agent splits task → specialized subagents (researcher / coder / tester / reviewer) in parallel → merge results.

Self-repair loop:
Executor → Tester → Reviewer iterate with structured feedback until all pass.

Worktree isolation:
Risky changes run in isolated git worktrees; you pick the winner.

Proactive / background agency:
- Notification-driven agent — background service attaches to notification channel; build failures / crashes trigger a proposed fix; approval from lock screen
- Proactive background mode — agent runs while you use your phone; approvals arrive as notifications
